{"parentUuid":"aa3b62ee-adf9-4428-acf1-a6daadfef7c7","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/ledgerline","sessionId":"insight-06","version":"2.0.14","gitBranch":"fix/compose-startup","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_01ihO5oBUTiinPBK3LzWqOgV","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-sonnet-4-5","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01xVFxLKvMK7rTaYafVS0sUU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"docker compose logs db | grep -E \"listening on|running|ready to accept|shut down|init process\""}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","usage":{"input_tokens":330,"output_tokens":311}},"uuid":"78d0d15a-a71b-4faf-ac5e-f4520d6c531f","timestamp":"2026-10-01T20:07:07.000Z","requestId":"req_011CcIhFTKaKva5BQNWeB7QW"}
{"parentUuid":"78d0d15a-a71b-4faf-ac5e-f4520d6c531f","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/ledgerline","sessionId":"insight-06","version":"2.0.14","gitBranch":"fix/compose-startup","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01xVFxLKvMK7rTaYafVS0sUU","content":"db-1  | LOG:  listening on Unix socket \"/var/run/postgresql/.s.PGSQL.5432\"\ndb-1  | LOG:  database system is ready to accept connections\ndb-1  | /usr/local/bin/docker-entrypoint.sh: running /docker-entrypoint-initdb.d/001_schema.sql\ndb-1  | LOG:  database system is shut down\ndb-1  | PostgreSQL init process complete; ready for start up.\ndb-1  | LOG:  listening on IPv4 address \"0.0.0.0\", port 5432\ndb-1  | LOG:  listening on Unix socket \"/var/run/postgresql/.s.PGSQL.5432\"\ndb-1  | LOG:  database system is ready to accept connections"}]},"uuid":"83cb112a-74bd-4c5c-a5fe-77d818465988","timestamp":"2026-10-01T20:07:10.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"83cb112a-74bd-4c5c-a5fe-77d818465988","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/ledgerline","sessionId":"insight-06","version":"2.0.14","gitBranch":"fix/compose-startup","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_01EREqAzULPHQsiDtrDZvxot","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-sonnet-4-5","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That is the cause. The postgres image first starts a temporary server on the unix socket only, runs the scripts in /docker-entrypoint-initdb.d against it, shuts it down and then starts the real server. pg_isready -U postgres talks to the unix socket by default, so it reports 'accepting connections' while the temporary server is up, before 001_schema.sql has finished. The healthcheck goes green early, api starts and finds no accounts table. Over TCP (-h 127.0.0.1) pg_isready only answers once the real server is up, after the init scripts."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","usage":{"input_tokens":490,"output_tokens":254}},"uuid":"ceae764c-9da3-48a1-a8f5-7dd539761817","timestamp":"2026-10-01T20:07:15.000Z","requestId":"req_011CNuFHXREEjobrsf8GacIw"}
{"parentUuid":"ceae764c-9da3-48a1-a8f5-7dd539761817","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/ledgerline","sessionId":"insight-06","version":"2.0.14","gitBranch":"fix/compose-startup","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Makes sense. Use the TCP check, and make it check the ledger database too."},"uuid":"94466cee-65e6-437d-a6cd-71d106cb6dfa","timestamp":"2026-10-01T20:07:32.000Z"}
{"parentUuid":"94466cee-65e6-437d-a6cd-71d106cb6dfa","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/dev/ledgerline","sessionId":"insight-06","version":"2.0.14","gitBranch":"fix/compose-startup","type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_014MjMlGG5AM8KHUAusZ2guk","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-sonnet-4-5","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HRadQubAXlhkek8kFMekd2","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/home/dev/ledgerline/docker-compose.yml","old_string":"test: [\"CMD-SHELL\", \"pg_isready -U postgres\"]","new_string":"test: [\"CMD-SHELL\", \"pg_isready -h 127.0.0.1 -U postgres -d ledger\"]"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","usage":{"input_tokens":201,"output_tokens":402}},"uuid":"e1e904b2-90ed-41f5-a8ae-4afa1ae9f009","timestamp":"2026-10-01T20:07:36.000Z","requestId":"req_011CSgcrIi1MqQi60NEL7VFS"}
